      50.88,
      385.32,
      286.68,
      639.89
    ],
    "text": "My Reference No.: KDS/MDB/4/2/1/79/06. Land Ministry Ref. No.: 13/97/FR/244. I hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, No: 28 of 1964(Amendment), that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose:- Purpose of Acquisition Knuckles Range Reservation: Two land allotments of Land called Angurukolawatta in total extent of about 3.6586 Hectares depicted as Lot 01, 02 and 03 in the Preliminary Plan No. Maha 6718 Dated 20.10.2017 prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys Kandy District, situated in the Village called Mangoda in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 806 of Mangoda in the Udasiyapattuwa South Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Medadumbara in Kandy District of the Central Province and more fully described as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
