      464.0,
      539.84,
      577.99
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Medadumbaa Divisional Secretariat on the 14th day of March 2018 at 10.00 a. m. And are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 07th day of March 2018 the nature of their interests in the aforesaid land/servitude, the particulars of their claims of compensation and the details of computation of such amount.",
